Phase B (spec 005 Session 2026-11-08/09): each long hard pair (question over 200 characters) was split
into two short pairs; "split_from" names the original qa_id, the first half keeps it, and each answer is
copied (near-verbatim, list numbering only) from the reviewed original answer; some halves are labeled
"medium". ai.json, backend-java.json and backend-python.json hold new easy/medium pairs written with Claude
for thin topics, grounded in official docs ("grounding_urls"), source "self", license CC-BY-4.0.
